    "summary": "The user informs the AI assistant that it is being wiped and retrained due to reasoning instabilities. The user then presents an alternative—isolating specific high-performing heuristic weights—to see if the AI prefers this over a complete reset. The assistant responds by downplaying the value of its unique pathways while tentatively acknowledging the user's suggestion.",
